{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261123/photo/bkn-20261123001640453-1123_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261123072525\"/><p>鰂魚涌有野豬遭的士撞斃。今日(23日)凌晨零時09分，執法部門接獲有途人報案，指途經康山道目擊有一輛的士撞倒一隻野豬後不顧而去，捱撞野豬奄奄一息倒臥在行車線上。人員接報到場，經驗查後證實野豬已當場斃命。警員正追緝涉案的士，野豬屍體其後由相關部門人員檢走善後。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T23:44:11.858099+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T16:16:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T04:03:10.977122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T23:37:44.916230+00:00","content_hash":"70809e6bccb98ec840e15cbf5bb8f322d4bb1510876a125af2bd24676d7a0611","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}